// # Ahamkara Core — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Root module hub for the openOODA Ahamkara query engine.
// Version: 1.1.0
//
// Setup: FsReadCap required for lore loading; pure in-memory search and formatting.
//
// Beats:
//   1. main.oo: CLI argument parser, query router, and REPL entry point.
//   2. model: Domain types for canonical Ahamkara lore records and query filters.
//   3. repo: Streaming JSONL data access and decoupled database contract.
//   4. engine: Case-insensitive search, multi-attribute filtering, and corpus analytics.
//   5. cli: Terminal card formatting and interactive exploration session.

pub fn ahamkara_version() -> String {
    return "1.1.0";
}
